# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

.idea/
output/
input/
expiremental/
db.sqlite
db.sqlite-journal
db.sqlite-wal
db.sqlite-shm

# Databases written by `ptsync db` take their name from whatever the run was called
# with, so they cannot be listed individually — and one over a personal archive
# reaches hundreds of MB. Untracked, they would otherwise be swept into a
# `cargo package` tarball, which crates.io caps at 10 MiB. Covers thumbs.db too,
# the thumbnail cache built by expiremental/ui-axum-htmx and rebuildable from
# db.sqlite.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
